    "Collector": "Collector",
    "Secret key": "Geheimer Schlüssel",
    "Send traces to your collector. Choose what to include below; account credentials stay local": "Traces an Ihren Collector senden. Unten festlegen, was enthalten ist; Zugangsdaten der Konten bleiben lokal",
